.el .ds Aq '
.TH photocraft-cli-info 1  "info " 
.SH NAME
photocraft\-cli\-info \- Print the document as JSON (size, mode, depth, layer tree)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBphotocraft\-cli info\fR [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-\-approve\-high\-memory\fR] [\fB\-\-detail\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the document as JSON (size, mode, depth, layer tree)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
One line of JSON instead of pretty\-printed
.TP
\fB\-\-approve\-high\-memory\fR
Explicitly approve high\-memory PSD/PSB imports within the hard memory budget
.TP
\fB\-\-detail\fR
Also list every text run and paragraph run, anti\-aliasing and full layer\-effect settings
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>

